 2.  **Signed Distance Query:**
-    a. Compute the signed distance: $d_{\text{signed}} = \mathbf{n} \cdot \mathbf{q} + d$ [S1, S2, unofficial].
-    b. Return $d_{\text{signed}}$ [S1, S2, unofficial].
